=========================================================================

beefcat is netcat for the BEEF data carrier, with SPV. A sender cuts any
bytes into chunks and signs each into a carrier: a transaction that can
never be mined, spending one mined funding output. The far end checks
each carrier against block headers it fetches itself, and writes a
carrier's data only after that carrier verified.

The data is never mined. It verifies by SPV through the mined output its
carrier spends, without paying for block space, and its sender can
retract it by spending that output. Data that does not verify, a sender
who is not the one pinned, a stream cut short, and retracted data are
refused loudly.

