  BRC-48:  Pay to Push Drop
  BRC-62:  Background Evaluation Extended Format
  BRC-67:  Simplified Payment Verification
  BRC-74:  BSV Unified Merkle Path
  BRC-95:  Atomic BEEF
  BRC-29:  Simple Authenticated BSV P2PKH Payment Protocol
  BRC-33:  PeerServ Message Relay Interface
