  https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6979

=========================================================================
Interoperability

beefcat speaks published standards and holds no private protocol beyond
the payload header and framing in docs/frozen.md. Any program that can
check a BEEF against block headers can verify a carrier, and any program
that follows docs/frozen.md can read or write a stream.

